<title>ZIMBABWE: Barclays Bank Zimbabwe to lay off staff.</title>
<headline>Barclays Bank Zimbabwe to lay off staff.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barclays Bank of Zimbabwe said on Thursday it had introduced a voluntary redundancy scheme to cut down its staff and boost efficiency through the use of new technology.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement the total redundancy payment in the coming year would be potentially in excess of Z$30 million but did not specify how many people would be laid off.</p>
<p>-- Harare newsroom: +263-4 72 52 27/8/9</p>
</text>
